{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_5_level_main_05-04_beg","groupId":"main_5","stageId":"main_05-04","title":"没人在家","storyCode":"5-4","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_05-04_beg.txt","sourceHash":"ad37d66a0c4f1557918e3f769918cb5213a1495772a4e4ced5071a6e9fb5a6e9","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第四关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_uptown_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"星熊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你脸色不大好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我没事，只是在想事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......我没想到他会被卷进来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"没事，你知道我的。过去的都过去了，用龙门话来说，这是命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"东国人也会信这个？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"经历这么了这么多事，即使我不信，现在也已经认了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"线报没问题吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"准确无误。这里就是线报记载的位置了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的目标，是那些鬼鬼祟祟的整合运动吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"看来他们没发现我们，还不知道近卫局已经把他们彻底包围了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"似乎在围绕着整座街区搭建着什么的样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"不出意外的话，这里是连接着整合运动各个据点的中心枢纽之一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我们摧毁这里的通讯收发设施，可以狠狠地打击整个区域内的敌人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"这能增添我们最后反攻近卫局大楼的胜算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"都听你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我也很在意情报线索的细节内容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你是说，整合运动在这儿活动，可不单单是想建个还算牢靠的据点，是吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你猜对了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"“敌人正秘密寻找高价值目标，需优先确认其行动。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"他们在富人区干些什么？这能有什么高价值目标？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我也觉得有问题。按照之前的计划，这条街道上的任何建筑都应当空无一人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"如果整合运动是在预谋绑架谁，那他们可能没机会抓住这位幸运市民了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我们什么时候动手？整合运动似乎不喜欢布置侦查小队，我们随时可以突袭他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"一直在做猎人，从来没做过猎物吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"这时候成为猎物，马上就会没命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"还是先仔细观察一下。我们要优先确认敌人的目的，却不是要折腾他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"摧毁目标轻而易举，想要了解敌人的目标却需要我们的耐心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"明白。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！老陈，他们是不是想要破坏那栋宅子的大门？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"已经确定了目标建筑？快，整队！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"要为市民减少点损失是吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"那是自然！狙击手，待命！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"明白。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是龙门的军队！撤退！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"联络——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"狙击手！射击那个背着无线电台的家伙！别让他发讯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"明明该固守据点，第一反应居然是跑？肯定有鬼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"想跑就跑，跑得了吗！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陈"]},{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["近卫局成员"]},{"speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","aliases":["星熊"]}]}
